{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CggMupaEp5bdei44Mvw9T","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"在把程式碼推送到伺服器之前，你需要先設定 SSH 金鑰。如果你已經有金鑰，可以跳過這個步驟。要產生新的金鑰，請開啟終端機並執行 `ssh-keygen -t ed25519`。這個指令會詢問你要把金鑰存放在哪裡，直接按 Enter 就會使用預設位置 `~/.ssh`。接著會提示你輸入密碼短語（passphrase）。密碼短語雖然不是必填，但我們強烈建議設定，因為萬一電腦遺失或被偷，它能保護你的金鑰。金鑰建立完成後，請複製公開金鑰檔案的內容，並貼到帳號設定中的「SSH 金鑰」區塊。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8375,"cache_read_input_tokens":28761,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8375},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8af65f4-a396-46fa-a10e-8dfadc17a795","uuid":"1ee689c6-4604-4fba-8238-0b49d4b1150a","timestamp":"2026-11-03T17:07:25.256Z","request_id":"req_011CggMupKMcMAiaZ3qG2o7P"}
